<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>I'm Truly Sorry... ❤️</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&family=Cinzel:wght@600;700&family=Georgia&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0005 0%, #4a000b 50%, #2b0000 100%);
      color: #f8d7da;
      font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 15px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      background: rgba(30, 0, 8, 0.94);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 26px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 20px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.3);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .hidden { display: none !important; }

    .fade-in {
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9) translateY(15px); }
      100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ffd700;
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
    }

    p { 
      font-size: 14.5px; 
      line-height: 1.6; 
      color: #f1d1d4;
    }

    /* Letter Container Styling */
    .letter-box {
      background: #fdf6e2;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#e0c9a6 1px, transparent 0);
      background-size: 12px 12px;
      border: 2px solid #8b5a2b;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(139, 90, 43, 0.3), 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      text-align: left;
      max-height: 340px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .letter-box::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 4px;
    }

    .letter-box::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #c29b68;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .letter-box p {
      font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
      color: #2b0000;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #800020, #b3002d);
      color: #ffd700;
      border: 1px solid #ffd700;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 30px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 12px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(128, 0, 32, 0.5);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:active { transform: scale(0.96); }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      border-color: #777;
      color: #bbb;
      margin-top: 8px;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .response-container {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #ffd700;
      min-height: 40px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- VIEW 1: Opening Note -->
  <div id="view1" class="card fade-in">
    <h1>I Need to Tell You Something...</h1>
    <p style="margin: 15px 0;">I know things haven't been right between us, and it weighs heavy on my heart. I made mistakes, and I am truly, deeply sorry.</p>
    <button id="openLetterBtn" class="btn">Read My Apology ✉️</button>
  </div>

  <!-- VIEW 2: The Core Apology Letter -->
  <div id="view2" class="card hidden">
    <h1>From My Heart</h1>
    
    <div class="letter-box">
      <p>
        I know I'm not always a good friend, and maybe that's why I apologize so much. Perhaps I’ve just grown too comfortable with you, taking your presence for granted.<br><br>
        “Of course you'll hurt me,<br>
        Of course I'll hurt you,<br>
        Of course we'll hurt each other.<br>
        But perhaps this is the very condition of existence.<br>
        To become spring means accepting the risk of winter.<br>
        To become presence means accepting the risk of absence.”<br><br>
        We’ve hurt each other, and that breaks my heart because losing you or drifting away is something I never want to face. You mean too much to me.<br><br>
        Please forgive me for my flaws and for the times I let you down.<br><br>
        — Always yours ❤️
      </p>
    </div>

    <button id="forgiveBtn" class="btn">Can you forgive me? 🤝</button>
    <button id="backBtn" class="btn btn-secondary">⬅️ Back</button>

    <div id="responseMsg" class="response-container"></div>
  </div>
  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const view1 = document.getElementById('view1');
      const view2 = document.getElementById('view2');
      const openLetterBtn = document.getElementById('openLetterBtn');
      const forgiveBtn = document.getElementById('forgiveBtn');
      const backBtn = document.getElementById('backBtn');
      const responseMsg = document.getElementById('responseMsg');

      openLetterBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        view1.classList.add('hidden');
        view2.classList.remove('hidden');
        view2.classList.add('fade-in');
      });

      backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        view2.classList.add('hidden');
        view1.classList.remove('hidden');
        view1.classList.add('fade-in');
        responseMsg.innerText = "";
      });

      forgiveBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const messages = [
          "Thank you for having such a kind and forgiving heart. I promise to do better. ❤️",
          "Your understanding means everything to me. I won't take you for granted. ✨",
          "Thank you for staying. We'll get through this together. 🫂"
        ];
        const randomMsg = messages[Math.floor(Math.random() * messages.length)];
        responseMsg.innerText = randomMsg;
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
